{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"推荐算法基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"collaborative-filtering","title":"协同过滤算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/foundations/collaborative-filtering","wordCount":1319,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"content-based-filtering","title":"基于内容的推荐算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/foundations/content-based-filtering","wordCount":1310,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"hybrid-methods","title":"混合推荐方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/recommendation-algorithms/foundations/hybrid-methods","wordCount":1291,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 推荐算法基础\n\n本章建立推荐算法的理论根基。协同过滤从用户行为中挖掘隐含偏好，内容过滤从物品属性出发匹配用户兴趣，混合方法将两者的优势有机结合。理解这三种范式的核心假设与局限性，是后续深入深度学习推荐和工业级系统架构的必要前提。\n\n每篇文档聚焦一个范式，深入解析其数学原理、典型算法与实际工程中的适用场景。建议按顺序阅读，因为混合方法的理解依赖于对前两种纯范式的充分掌握。\n"}